{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46979","headline":"中秋十五夜寄人 · 齐己","name":"中秋十五夜寄人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高河瑟瑟转金盘，歕露吹光逆凭栏。\n四海鱼龙精魄冷，五山鸾鹤骨毛寒。\n今宵尽向圆时望，後夜谁当缺处看。\n何事清光与蟾兔，却教才小少留难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}